0..74 Comment "// What does not cross, refused where it would. A migration\'s result comes"
75..152 Comment "// back to the world it left, and only what is mobile and open comes back: an"
153..227 Comment "// unmarked abstract type stays with its seal, a handle stays when what it"
228..295 Comment "// holds is not open, and a thunk stays when what it captures does."
297..371 Comment "// The operator\'s and the seat\'s worlds, and the seat\'s sealed side of the"
372..416 Comment "// exchange, its report alone marked mobile."
